          "message": {
            "text": "All new human and AI writes converge on one normalized target shape while legacy v1 aliases remain readable. Owner inference rejects cross-scene track/action/layer combinations, and project-scoped DOM or scene-coordinate evidence fails rather than becoming ambiguous.",
            "markdown": "All new human and AI writes converge on one normalized target shape while legacy v1 aliases remain readable. Owner inference rejects cross-scene track/action/layer combinations, and project-scoped DOM or scene-coordinate evidence fails rather than becoming ambiguous."
          },
