          "guid": "mtpiptm6a3rrq63v",
          "message": {
            "text": "SVG review migration preserves an independent observed frame and selected range, prefers modern multiple regions, binds SVG user-unit coordinates only to a source SVG artifact, and drops absolute machine paths. The clipboard adapter reuses the canonical dependency-neutral REGIONS parser and converts syntax to structured data at the boundary.",
            "markdown": "SVG review migration preserves an independent observed frame and selected range, prefers modern multiple regions, binds SVG user-unit coordinates only to a source SVG artifact, and drops absolute machine paths. The clipboard adapter reuses the canonical dependency-neutral REGIONS parser and converts syntax to structured data at the boundary."
          },
          "locations": [
